{"id":"a0c7f4bf5e51d4b5","group":"14","path":"14/14-df-subobject-classifier.md","title":"Definition — Subobject Classifier","display":"Definition — Subobject Classifier","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Sheaves in Geometry and Logic (Mac Lane & Moerdijk)","book_abbrev":"14","label":"14-df-subobject-classifier","aliases":["14-df-subobject-classifier"],"display":"Definition — Subobject Classifier","depends_on":["[[14-df-monomorphism-epimorphism]]","[[14-df-terminal-initial-objects-products]]","[[14-df-pullbacks-equalizers]]","[[14-df-subobjects]]"],"source_status":"来源定位沿用附件笔记；本次未重新核验原书文件。"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Sheaves in Geometry and Logic (Mac Lane &amp; Moerdijk)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"14"},{"key":"label","html":"14-df-subobject-classifier"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>14-df-subobject-classifier</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"Definition — Subobject Classifier"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"8e7f6de1ab6fc49f\" href=\"?note=8e7f6de1ab6fc49f\" title=\"14-df-monomorphism-epimorphism\">14-df-monomorphism-epimorphism</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"1044b7940aaa4f1f\" href=\"?note=1044b7940aaa4f1f\" title=\"14-df-terminal-initial-objects-products\">14-df-terminal-initial-objects-products</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"199dc3cf97e92fa1\" href=\"?note=199dc3cf97e92fa1\" title=\"14-df-pullbacks-equalizers\">14-df-pullbacks-equalizers</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"d3923e299ec2ec5a\" href=\"?note=d3923e299ec2ec5a\" title=\"14-df-subobjects\">14-df-subobjects</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_status","html":"来源定位沿用附件笔记；本次未重新核验原书文件。"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal C\">\\(\\mathcal C\\)</span> 为范畴，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Omega\">\\(\\Omega\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"t\">\\(t\\)</span> 为候选分类子数据。终对象、拉回和单态射见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"1044b7940aaa4f1f\" href=\"?note=1044b7940aaa4f1f\" title=\"14-df-terminal-initial-objects-products\">14-df-terminal-initial-objects-products</a>、<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"199dc3cf97e92fa1\" href=\"?note=199dc3cf97e92fa1\" title=\"14-df-pullbacks-equalizers\">14-df-pullbacks-equalizers</a>、<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"8e7f6de1ab6fc49f\" href=\"?note=8e7f6de1ab6fc49f\" title=\"14-df-monomorphism-epimorphism\">14-df-monomorphism-epimorphism</a>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{IsSubobjectClassifier}\">\\(\\mathrm{IsSubobjectClassifier}\\)</span> 仅在环境固定时缩写带 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal C\">\\(\\mathcal C\\)</span> 下标的谓词。</p>\n<p>特征函数各式另假设 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{IsSubobjectClassifier}_{\\mathcal C}(\\Omega,t)\">\\(\\mathrm{IsSubobjectClassifier}_{\\mathcal C}(\\Omega,t)\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"1=\\mathrm{dom}_{\\mathcal C}(t)\">\\(1=\\mathrm{dom}_{\\mathcal C}(t)\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"m:S\\hookrightarrow X\">\\(m:S\\hookrightarrow X\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\in\\mathrm{Sub}_{\\mathcal C}(X)\">\\(A\\in\\mathrm{Sub}_{\\mathcal C}(X)\\)</span>。子对象商集见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"d3923e299ec2ec5a\" href=\"?note=d3923e299ec2ec5a\" title=\"14-df-subobjects\">14-df-subobjects</a>。固定 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(\\mathcal C,\\Omega,t)\">\\((\\mathcal C,\\Omega,t)\\)</span> 后，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\chi_m\">\\(\\chi_m\\)</span> 缩写 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Char}_{\\mathcal C,\\Omega,t}(m)\">\\(\\mathrm{Char}_{\\mathcal C,\\Omega,t}(m)\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\chi_A\">\\(\\chi_A\\)</span> 缩写 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{CharSub}_{\\mathcal C,\\Omega,t,X}(A)\">\\(\\mathrm{CharSub}_{\\mathcal C,\\Omega,t,X}(A)\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\top\">\\(\\top\\)</span> 可作 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"t\">\\(t\\)</span> 的别名。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{IsSubobjectClassifier}_{\\mathcal C}(\\Omega,t)\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\\Omega\\in\\mathrm{Ob}(\\mathcal C)\\land\\exists T\\in\\mathrm{Ob}(\\mathcal C)\\ \\bigl(\\mathrm{IsTerminal}_{\\mathcal C}(T)\\land t\\in\\mathrm{Hom}_{\\mathcal C}(T,\\Omega)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall S,X\\in\\mathrm{Ob}(\\mathcal C)\\ \\forall m\\in\\mathrm{Hom}_{\\mathcal C}(S,X)\\ \\bigl(\\mathrm{IsMono}_{\\mathcal C}(m)\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{9mm}\\to\\exists!h\\in\\mathrm{Hom}_{\\mathcal C}(X,\\Omega)\\ \\exists u\\in\\mathrm{Hom}_{\\mathcal C}(S,T)\\ \\mathrm{IsPullback}_{\\mathcal C}(S,m,u,h,t)\\bigr)\\bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{IsSubobjectClassifier}_{\\mathcal C}(\\Omega,t)\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\\Omega\\in\\mathrm{Ob}(\\mathcal C)\\land\\exists T\\in\\mathrm{Ob}(\\mathcal C)\\ \\bigl(\\mathrm{IsTerminal}_{\\mathcal C}(T)\\land t\\in\\mathrm{Hom}_{\\mathcal C}(T,\\Omega)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall S,X\\in\\mathrm{Ob}(\\mathcal C)\\ \\forall m\\in\\mathrm{Hom}_{\\mathcal C}(S,X)\\ \\bigl(\\mathrm{IsMono}_{\\mathcal C}(m)\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{9mm}\\to\\exists!h\\in\\mathrm{Hom}_{\\mathcal C}(X,\\Omega)\\ \\exists u\\in\\mathrm{Hom}_{\\mathcal C}(S,T)\\ \\mathrm{IsPullback}_{\\mathcal C}(S,m,u,h,t)\\bigr)\\bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Char}_{\\mathcal C,\\Omega,t}(m)\\coloneqq\\iota h\\in\\mathrm{Hom}_{\\mathcal C}(X,\\Omega)\\ \\exists u\\in\\mathrm{Hom}_{\\mathcal C}(S,1)\\ \\mathrm{IsPullback}_{\\mathcal C}(S,m,u,h,t).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{Char}_{\\mathcal C,\\Omega,t}(m)\\coloneqq\\iota h\\in\\mathrm{Hom}_{\\mathcal C}(X,\\Omega)\\ \\exists u\\in\\mathrm{Hom}_{\\mathcal C}(S,1)\\ \\mathrm{IsPullback}_{\\mathcal C}(S,m,u,h,t).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\forall A\\in\\mathrm{Sub}_{\\mathcal C}(X)\\ \\exists!h\\in\\mathrm{Hom}_{\\mathcal C}(X,\\Omega)\\ \\forall m\\in A\\ (\\mathrm{Char}_{\\mathcal C,\\Omega,t}(m)=h).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\forall A\\in\\mathrm{Sub}_{\\mathcal C}(X)\\ \\exists!h\\in\\mathrm{Hom}_{\\mathcal C}(X,\\Omega)\\ \\forall m\\in A\\ (\\mathrm{Char}_{\\mathcal C,\\Omega,t}(m)=h).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{CharSub}_{\\mathcal C,\\Omega,t,X}(A)\\coloneqq\\iota h\\in\\mathrm{Hom}_{\\mathcal C}(X,\\Omega)\\ \\forall m\\in A\\ (\\mathrm{Char}_{\\mathcal C,\\Omega,t}(m)=h).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{CharSub}_{\\mathcal C,\\Omega,t,X}(A)\\coloneqq\\iota h\\in\\mathrm{Hom}_{\\mathcal C}(X,\\Omega)\\ \\forall m\\in A\\ (\\mathrm{Char}_{\\mathcal C,\\Omega,t}(m)=h).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>原书定位：I.3；IV.1。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"!_S\">\\(!_S\\)</span> 在选定终对象后逐个唯一确定，修复旧文将存在量词中的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"u_X\">\\(u_X\\)</span> 越界用于 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"u_S\">\\(u_S\\)</span> 的问题。分类子建立 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Sub}(X)\\cong\\mathrm{Hom}(X,\\Omega)\">\\(\\mathrm{Sub}(X)\\cong\\mathrm{Hom}(X,\\Omega)\\)</span>；同一子对象的各代表给出同一特征箭头。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"14-df-monomorphism-epimorphism","status":"resolved","id":"8e7f6de1ab6fc49f","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[14-df-monomorphism-epimorphism]]","embed":false},{"target":"14-df-terminal-initial-objects-products","status":"resolved","id":"1044b7940aaa4f1f","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[14-df-terminal-initial-objects-products]]","embed":false},{"target":"14-df-pullbacks-equalizers","status":"resolved","id":"199dc3cf97e92fa1","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[14-df-pullbacks-equalizers]]","embed":false},{"target":"14-df-subobjects","status":"resolved","id":"d3923e299ec2ec5a","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[14-df-subobjects]]","embed":false},{"target":"14-df-terminal-initial-objects-products","status":"resolved","id":"1044b7940aaa4f1f","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathcal C$ 为范畴，$\\Omega$、$t$ 为候选分类子数据。终对象、拉回和单态射见 [[14-df-terminal-initial-objects-products]]、[[14-df-pullbacks-equalizers]]、[[14-df-monomorphism-epimorphism]]。$\\mathrm{IsSubobjectClassifier}$ 仅在环境固定时缩写带 $\\mathcal C$ 下标的谓词。","embed":false},{"target":"14-df-pullbacks-equalizers","status":"resolved","id":"199dc3cf97e92fa1","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathcal C$ 为范畴，$\\Omega$、$t$ 为候选分类子数据。终对象、拉回和单态射见 [[14-df-terminal-initial-objects-products]]、[[14-df-pullbacks-equalizers]]、[[14-df-monomorphism-epimorphism]]。$\\mathrm{IsSubobjectClassifier}$ 仅在环境固定时缩写带 $\\mathcal C$ 下标的谓词。","embed":false},{"target":"14-df-monomorphism-epimorphism","status"