l S,X\\in\\mathrm{Ob}(\\mathcal C)\\ \\forall m\\in\\mathrm{Hom}_{\\mathcal C}(S,X)\\ \\bigl(\\mathrm{IsMono}_{\\mathcal C}(m)\\\\\n&\\hspace{9mm}\\to\\exists!h\\in\\mathrm{Hom}_{\\mathcal C}(X,\\Omega)\\ \\exists u\\in\\mathrm{Hom}_{\\mathcal C}(S,T)\\ \\mathrm{IsPullback}_{\\mathcal C}(S,m,u,h,t)\\bigr)\\bigr).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Char}_{\\mathcal C,\\Omega,t}(m)\\coloneqq\\iota h\\in\\mathrm{Hom}_{\\mathcal C}(X,\\Omega)\\ \\exists u\\in\\mathrm{Hom}_{\\mathcal C}(S,1)\\ \\mathrm{IsPullback}_{\\mathcal C}(S,m,u,h,t).","display":true},{"tex":"\\forall A\\in\\mathrm{Sub}_{\\mathcal C}(X)\\ \\exists!h\\in\\mathrm{Hom}_{\\mathcal C}(X,\\Omega)\\ \\forall m\\in A\\ (\\mathrm{Char}_{\\mathcal C,\\Omega,t}(m)=h).","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{CharSub}_{\\mathcal C,\\Omega,t,X}(A)\\coloneqq\\iota h\\in\\mathrm{Hom}_{\\mathcal C}(X,\\Omega)\\ \\forall m\\in A\\ (\\mathrm{Char}_{\\mathcal C,\\Omega,t}(m)=h).","display":true},{"tex":"!_S","display":false},{"tex":"u_X","display":false},{"tex":"u_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Sub}(X)\\cong\\mathrm{Hom}(X,\\Omega)","display":false}],"bytes":2624,"backlinks":[{"id":"c53146be63465990","anchor":"ref-18","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[14-df-subobject-classifier|Definition — Subobject Classifier]]"},{"id":"c10899c45464ad7f","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"4e6c05c92e3b9bf9","anchor":"ref-11","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{IsSubobjectClassifier}$ (classifier predicate, see [[14-df-subobject-classifier]])"},{"id":"c22badb838a7fca1","anchor":"ref-13","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$⟦\\varphi⟧_{M,\\vec x}\\in\\mathrm{Sub}_{\\mathcal E}(M_{\\vec x})$；$\\chi_\\varphi$ 是其 [[14-df-subobject-classifier]] 特征箭头。仅在结构和上下文固定时使用 $⟦-⟧_{\\mathcal E}$ 缩写。"},{"id":"4741fef73eb1a614","anchor":"ref-12","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[14-df-subobject-classifier]]"},{"id":"eeccd7d0ab927af1","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"f2ca2aad80752c90","anchor":"ref-6","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathcal E$ 为固定初等拓扑斯，$j:\\Omega\\to\\Omega$ 为 Lawvere–Tierney 拓扑，$X\\in\\mathrm{Ob}(\\mathcal E)$。$\\chi_A:X\\to\\Omega$ 是子对象 $A$ 的唯一特征箭头；它由 [[14-df-subobject-classifier]] 与 [[14-df-subobjects]] 的代表等价确定。子对象序及运算见 [[14-df-subobject-order-inverse-image]]、[[14-df-subobject-lattice-operations]]。$\\mathrm{Cl}_j$ 在本条绑定的 $X$ 上解释。"},{"id":"4b8f9443a0ee72c6","anchor":"ref-7","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\Omega\\in\\mathrm{Ob}(\\mathcal E)$ and $\\top:1\\to\\Omega$ (subobject classifier, see [[14-df-subobject-classifier]])"},{"id":"d061a7977fcae989","anchor":"ref-5","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$*:=\\varnothing$。分类子谓词采用 [[14-df-subobject-classifier]]，环境范畴为下式定义的 $BM$。"},{"id":"46d4e2094b01f6d4","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"f6ccc7c06d940d91","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"7df95b777d9b2ddd","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"ffda0c0482667c45","anchor":"ref-12","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[14-df-subobject-classifier]]"},{"id":"c60ad289d123497b","anchor":"ref-19","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[14-df-subobject-classifier|Definition — Subobject Classifier]]"},{"id":"68f3350ee8219486","anchor":"ref-11","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$(\\mathcal C,J)$ 为小站点，$S,T$ 为 $C$ 上的筛，$g:D\\to C$。$\\operatorname{cl}_J,\\operatorname{JClosed},t_C,g^*$ 见 [[14-df-closed-sieve]]；$\\Omega_J,t_J,\\chi_A^J$ 见 [[14-df-closed-sieve-presheaf]]。$A\\subseteq F$ 为子层，$m:A\\to F$ 为包含自然变换，$!_A:A\\to1$ 为终箭头。$\\operatorname{IsPullback}_{\\mathbf{Sh}(\\mathcal C,J)}$ 与分类子谓词分别采用[[14-df-pullbacks-equalizers]]与[[14-df-subobject-classifier]]的泛性质，后者的环境范畴取 $\\mathbf{Sh}(\\mathcal C,J)$。"},{"id":"ba35738413a412b8","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"3130f90b274154ec","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"f0231586326fcfff","anchor":"ref-9","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"这是利用本书幂对象、内部等价关系与核对的具体重构，新增的公式不是原书 IV.6 Proposition 1 的原样陈述。原稿记录曾读 IV.5–7 本地 OCR（图96–105），其像与核对背景分别在184–186、197–198页；指数/分类子使用已核对的[[14-df-subobject-classifier]]与[[14-df-exponentials]]。所有论证在任意参数对象上进行，不把内部对象当成外部集合。"},{"id":"3ac28cc449b6cd1f","anchor":"ref-9","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"0e7878d33550867c","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"d0648d6c0cc0fcf3","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"592d7bea8469dc16","anchor":"ref-5","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"2f47f9749d4510aa","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"abb55776f8cac91e","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"b8d0caa944c37be9","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"abee8603b9a8b54a","anchor":"ref-12","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"$\\mathcal E$ 是初等拓扑斯，固定分类子 $(\\Omega,t)$、有限极限与指数；$B\\in\\operatorname{Ob}(\\mathcal E)$。切片与底层箭头投影 $b_B$ 见[[14-df-slice-category]]，切片分类子见[[14-thm-slice-subobject-classifier]]。$P=(C,p:C\\to B)$、$Q=(Z,q:Z\\to B)$ 是切片对象。$P_C=\\Omega^C$，$\\operatorname{ev}_C:P_C\\times C\\to\\Omega$；$\\lambda_C$ 是以 $C$ 为指数参数的转置。$\\delta_B$ 是下式定义的对角分类箭头，$\\chi_m$ 采用 [[14-df-subobject-classifier]]。下式中的各 $\\pi$ 均为相应已选积投影；$\\Theta_{P,Q}$ 中的 $(-)^{-1}$ 为 [[14-df-subobject-order-inverse-image]] 的子对象逆像函数。"},{"id":"d3c2290aa1563742","anchor":"ref-1","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"f097cd189a36cae9","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"7a7888e53e3d006d","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""}],"outgoing":["8e7f6de1ab6fc49f","1044b7940aaa4f1f","199dc3cf97e92fa1","d3923e299ec2ec5a"]}